# Press Play to authorize microphone input. No input permission is requested on load.
# i means i1, the first channel of the selected browser input device.
# !i1 is input trim on a 0..1 scale; v keeps the normal 0..9 sound level.
# Stop releases the microphone. id0.3 = channel 1 + delay 0.3 seconds.
!i1=(0.9)
id0.3v3e0'30
